#: ../../tools/huggingface_tools.rst:32 210fdccdfba442a48c0b804c736d519a
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get detailed metadata for a specific model on "
"HuggingFace Hub by its author and model name. Returns comprehensive "
"information including model architecture, tags, download/like counts, "
"creation date, license, widget data for interactive testing, and card "
"metadata. Model IDs on HuggingFace follow the 'author/model-name' format;"
" provide the author and model\\_name as separate parameters. Use "
"HuggingFace\\_search\\_models to find model IDs (the 'id' field returns "
"'author/model-name')."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/huggingface_tools.rst:34 ../../tools/huggingface_tools.rst:69
